---
interface Props {
  total: number;
  categoryCount: number;
}
const { total, categoryCount } = Astro.props;
---
<section class="home-intro grid items-center gap-6 pb-8 pt-2 lg:grid-cols-[1.15fr_0.85fr] lg:gap-8 lg:pb-10 lg:pt-5">
  <p class="sr-only"><span data-lang="en">Three steps: browse, copy, and paste into your agent.</span><span data-lang="ko">사용 3단계: 카테고리에서 고르고, 원문을 복사하고, 에이전트에 붙여넣습니다.</span></p>
  <div>
    <h1 class="text-balance text-[clamp(2rem,1.1rem+2.6vw,2.8rem)] font-bold leading-[1.08] tracking-[-0.02em] text-ink-900 dark:text-ink-50">
      <span data-lang="en">Proven agent tools,<br /><span class="text-accent-600 dark:text-accent-400">one copy</span> away.</span>
      <span data-lang="ko">검증된 에이전트 도구를<br /><span class="text-accent-600 dark:text-accent-400">복사 한 번</span>으로 바로.</span>
    </h1>
    <p class="mt-4 max-w-xl text-sm text-pretty leading-relaxed text-ink-600 dark:text-ink-300">
      <span data-lang="en">Prompts, skills, hooks, and configs for Claude Code, Codex, Gemini CLI, and other AI coding agents, curated in one place.
      Browse without installing anything, then <strong class="font-semibold text-ink-800 dark:text-ink-100">copy the original</strong> and use it as-is.</span>
      <span data-lang="ko">Claude Code · Codex · Gemini CLI 등 AI 코딩 에이전트에 바로 붙여 넣는 프롬프트·스킬·훅·설정을 한곳에 모았습니다.
      설치 없이 둘러보고, 마음에 드는 항목의 <strong class="font-semibold text-ink-800 dark:text-ink-100">원문을 복사</strong>해 그대로 쓰세요.</span>
    </p>

    <div class="mt-5 flex flex-wrap items-center gap-3">
      <a href="#catalog" class="btn btn-primary px-5 py-2.5 text-sm">
        <span data-lang="en">Browse catalog</span><span data-lang="ko">카탈로그 둘러보기</span>
        <svg class="h-4 w-4" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true"><line x1="5" y1="12" x2="19" y2="12"/><polyline points="12 5 19 12 12 19"/></svg>
      </a>
      <a href="#how-it-works" class="btn btn-ghost px-5 py-2.5 text-sm">
        <span data-lang="en">How it works</span><span data-lang="ko">어떻게 쓰나요?</span>
      </a>
    </div>

    <p class="mt-5 text-sm text-ink-500 dark:text-ink-400">
      <span data-lang="en">{total} items · {categoryCount} categories · mostly open source</span>
      <span data-lang="ko">{total}개 항목 · {categoryCount}개 카테고리 · 대부분 오픈소스</span>
    </p>
  </div>

  <!-- Terminal demo: the browse → copy → paste flow (brand memory moment) -->
  <div class="pc-term hidden lg:block" aria-hidden="true">
    <div class="pc-term-bar">
      <span class="pc-term-dot bg-[#ff5f57]"></span>
      <span class="pc-term-dot bg-[#febc2e]"></span>
      <span class="pc-term-dot bg-[#28c840]"></span>
      <span class="ml-2 font-mono text-[0.7rem] text-ink-400">promptbox · 3 steps</span>
    </div>
    <div class="space-y-2.5 p-4">
      <p class="text-ink-400"><span data-lang="en"># 1 · choose a tool</span><span data-lang="ko"># 1 · 카테고리에서 도구를 고르고</span></p>
      <p class="break-all"><span class="text-accent-400">$</span> open promptbox/skills/<span class="text-ink-50">diagnose</span></p>
      <p class="text-ink-400"><span data-lang="en"># 2 · copy the original source</span><span data-lang="ko"># 2 · 상세 페이지에서 원문을 복사한 뒤</span></p>
      <p class="break-all"><span class="text-accent-400">$</span> pbpaste &gt; ~/.claude/skills/diagnose/<span class="text-ink-50">SKILL.md</span></p>
      <p class="text-ink-400"><span data-lang="en"># 3 · use it in your agent</span><span data-lang="ko"># 3 · 에이전트에서 바로 호출</span></p>
      <p><span class="text-accent-400">&gt;</span> /diagnose <span class="caret"></span></p>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
